WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Everyone has five dice and sees only their own;
lose them all and you are out. Last one left wins.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:15.999 line:0
A bid guesses how many dice on the whole table
show a face: North bids four 2s.

00:00:15.999 --> 00:00:19.499 line:0
East does not believe it and calls.

00:00:19.499 --> 00:00:28.998 line:0
Ones are wild: two 2s and two 1s make four.
The bid holds, so East loses a die.

00:00:28.998 --> 00:00:38.998 line:0
The loser opens the next round; everyone rerolls.

00:00:38.998 --> 00:00:52.998 line:0
Raise the count, or keep it and bid a higher face;
call if you do not believe the last bid.

00:00:52.998 --> 00:01:04.997 line:0
Fast-forward through the remaining rounds;
each call costs one side a die.

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:14.000 line:0
North loses their last die;
East still has three and wins.
